  "explanation": "The original sources D1S10 and D1S11 directly state that Jorge C. Romao worked for Oak Ridge National Laboratory from 2007 to 2012. Document D2S7 and D2S13 explicitly mention that Romao worked at Instituto Superior Técnico (IST), supported by additional references in D2S15–D2S20. These are distinct organizations and both are directly stated in the original context. The proposed candidate 'University of Lisbon' (C2) is not directly stated as an employer of Romao in any original source and is therefore not included."
